  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Women and Girls Through Sport and Celebrating UK-Samoa Link</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BHC Apia has agreed to pay the Samoa Women Team&#x2019;s registration fee for the Touch Rugby World Cup to support Samoa&#x2019;s full participation. We hope that this gesture will strengthen local relationships and enable these young women to access more sporting opportunities. The registration fee contribution also supports the UK and city of Nottingham as the host for the World Cup tournament 2024. In addition, the project proposal aligns with the &#x2018;FCDO&#x2019;s Women and Girls Strategy&#x2019; and creates an opportunity through sport and specifically rugby to reinforce Post&#x2019;s commitment to &#x2018;Empowering Women and Girls&#x2019; and strengthening UK-Samoa links.</narrative>
  </description>
